  "ruleText": "Csp 407.05 Reimbursement Procedures for Accelerated Programs. Participating postsecondary institutions that offer an eligible program that takes less than a semester or an academic year shall seek full reimbursement consistent with Csp 407.04.\n\nSource. #13144, eff 12-9-20 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Csp 400); ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
